{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>薔琵迫近台灣，香港快運取消周五多班香港來往台北、台中和高雄的航班，部分航班就需要延遲至周六。</p><p></p><p>2026年10月23日</p><p>香港 ←→ 台北</p><p>取消：UO 112、UO 113、UO 114、UO 115、UO 116、UO 117</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_SSS.FLIGHT.UO 1330.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026cernVh6yq71792650091.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>香港 ←→ 台中</p><p>取消：UO 172、UO 173</p><p>延期至2026年10月24日：</p><p>UO 182 → UO 182D （09:55）</p><p>UO 183 → UO 183D（12:20）</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_SSS.FLIGHT.UO 1330_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026ZwgG1bUFwG1792650110.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>香港 ←→ 高雄</p><p>取消：UO 134、UO 135</p><p>延期至2026年10月24日：</p><p>UO 136 → UO 136D（09:45）</p><p>UO 133 → UO 133D（12:00）</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_SSS.FLIGHT.UO 1330_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026il3Cu1kjby1792650125.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T07:22:14.586199+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":293,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T04:44:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T08:56:58.631728+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T07:17:55.366105+00:00","content_hash":"ab305cc702f633f458bf42336c2b7e4b0f102f16f4e1642548341a72ea157967","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}